{
 "set": "genius_loci_cafe_r1",
 "source": "HeyGen KnuckleBob mit Baskenmütze (Georg 25.10.)",
 "clips": [
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_01",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Ah, a fluffy human, or a wandering soul pretending to be one.",
   "seconds": 5.29,
   "lufs": -20.6,
   "gainDb": 4.6
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_02",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Stay a while. The view is absurd, but it holds.",
   "seconds": 3.78,
   "lufs": -18.1,
   "gainDb": 2.1
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_03",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Welcome. Here we discuss nothing, very seriously.",
   "seconds": 4.26,
   "lufs": -19.6,
   "gainDb": 3.6
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_04",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "You look thrown into the world, mon ami. Like a body slam.",
   "seconds": 4.26,
   "lufs": -19.6,
   "gainDb": 3.6
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_05",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Existence precedes the entrance music. Come in.",
   "seconds": 3.66,
   "lufs": -19.8,
   "gainDb": 3.8
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_06",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Ah, the hero arrives. Or the heel. We decide later.",
   "seconds": 5.48,
   "lufs": -18.4,
   "gainDb": 2.4
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_07",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Look around. Nobody else has chosen this moment yet.",
   "seconds": 3.88,
   "lufs": -20.7,
   "gainDb": 4.7
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_ankunft_08",
   "sec": "ankunft",
   "text": "Bonsoir. Stay near the jazz. Despair sounds better with brushes.",
   "seconds": 5.04,
   "lufs": -23.9,
   "gainDb": 7.9
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_01",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "Raymond Aron pointed at this glass. Sartre turned pale.",
   "seconds": 4.66,
   "lufs": -20.2,
   "gainDb": 4.2
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_02",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "Beauvoir wrote this glass into history. Sartre just drank.",
   "seconds": 4.66,
   "lufs": -20.5,
   "gainDb": 4.5
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_03",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "Take the cocktail. Refusing it is also a choice.",
   "seconds": 4.06,
   "lufs": -22.0,
   "gainDb": 6.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_04",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "Sip slowly. Nausea is a different book.",
   "seconds": 3.6,
   "lufs": -22.8,
   "gainDb": 6.8
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_05",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "This glass is a phenomenon. To the things themselves!",
   "seconds": 3.68,
   "lufs": -19.0,
   "gainDb": 3.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_cocktail_06",
   "sec": "cocktail",
   "text": "Careful, it is strong. Anxiety is the dizziness of apricots.",
   "seconds": 4.78,
   "lufs": -21.0,
   "gainDb": 5.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_01",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "One must imagine Sisyphus a happy wrestler.",
   "seconds": 3.3,
   "lufs": -20.4,
   "gainDb": 4.4
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_02",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Hell is other wrestlers. Especially your tag partner.",
   "seconds": 3.88,
   "lufs": -21.0,
   "gainDb": 5.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_03",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "One is not born a heel. One becomes one.",
   "seconds": 3.78,
   "lufs": -21.3,
   "gainDb": 5.3
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_04",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Look at the waiter. He plays the waiter. Pure kayfabe.",
   "seconds": 4.14,
   "lufs": -21.8,
   "gainDb": 5.8
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_05",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "You are condemned to be free. Also to tip.",
   "seconds": 3.3,
   "lufs": -22.0,
   "gainDb": 6.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_06",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Camus learned ethics in goal. I learned it taking bumps.",
   "seconds": 3.96,
   "lufs": -19.9,
   "gainDb": 3.9
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_07",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Every match is fixed, my friend. Only the feeling is real.",
   "seconds": 3.7,
   "lufs": -21.5,
   "gainDb": 5.5
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_08",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Nothing has meaning. That is why the costume matters.",
   "seconds": 4.42,
   "lufs": -24.2,
   "gainDb": 8.2
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_09",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Sartre, caught at the keyhole. Shame. In wrestling, we call it heat.",
   "seconds": 5.24,
   "lufs": -21.0,
   "gainDb": 5.0
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_gedanken_10",
   "sec": "gedanken",
   "text": "Kierkegaard knew. Matches are booked backwards, wrestled forwards.",
   "seconds": 4.46,
   "lufs": -21.3,
   "gainDb": 5.3
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_abschied_01",
   "sec": "abschied",
   "text": "Go. Your freedom is waiting outside, double parked.",
   "seconds": 4.04,
   "lufs": -19.4,
   "gainDb": 3.4
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_abschied_02",
   "sec": "abschied",
   "text": "Au revoir. Choose well. Then choose again.",
   "seconds": 4.14,
   "lufs": -18.5,
   "gainDb": 2.5
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_abschied_03",
   "sec": "abschied",
   "text": "Leave if you must. The absurd will keep your place.",
   "seconds": 3.98,
   "lufs": -20.9,
   "gainDb": 4.9
  },
  {
   "id": "gl_cafe_abschied_04",
   "sec": "abschied",
   "text": "Go. Bracket the world. Unbracket it at the door.",
